// Fernando (ABBA, 1976)

Tempo 102
Keysig A
Transpose Down Maj 3  // to 'F'

Set RptCount 1
Label SIGN   // to jump via DS

Repeat
Groove BossaNova

1         A
2         /
3         /
4         /

5       F#m
6         /
7        Bm
8         /

9         /
10        E
11        /

RepeatEnding $RptCount NoWarn

Truncate 2
12        /
13        A

RepeatEnd
Truncate 2
14        /
15        A
16        A

17       E7
18        /
19        A
20        /

21       E7
22        /
23        A
24      A7/G  /// score says A/G

25       F#
26       B7
27        /
28       E7

29        /
30        A

If Def TOCODA
  Goto Coda
endif

31        /
32       E7

33        /
34        D
35        /
36        A

37        /
38       E7
39        /
40        A

Set TOCODA
Set RptCount 0 
Goto SIGN
Label CODA


Decresc ppp 8
Repeat
41        A
42       E7
43        /
44        A
RepeatEnd


